#: ../../source/guide/linear_structures/priority_queue.rst:12
#: 8a6af220bb6540348e7c8498e7363947
msgid ""
"A **priority queue** is an abstract data structure where each element has"
" an associated **priority**. Elements are dequeued in priority order "
"rather than insertion order. Think of it like an emergency room: patients"
" are treated by urgency, not by arrival time."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/guide/linear_structures/priority_queue.rst:39
#: 64fcc455f3a94101a8eabb9cc275aedb
msgid ""
"By convention, **lower numeric values indicate higher priority** "
"(priority 1 > priority 5), similar to ranking systems. This can be "
"customized based on your needs."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/guide/linear_structures/priority_queue.rst:44
#: 54c00d9aab8c4fada0352754dd8cda26
msgid "Mathematical Model"
