#: ../../source/guide/linear_structures/priority_queue.rst:62
#: 23fb1e0e422f406fa727670a2cd3e9c2
#, python-brace-format
msgid "dequeue(PQ) = (e_i, PQ \\setminus \\{(e_i, p_i)\\})"
