#: ../../source/guide/linear_structures/priority_queue.rst:66
#: 0702f2c61d4d4eddb3eae41caf780d2f
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"where :math:`p_i = \\min_{(e, p) \\in PQ} p` (assuming lower = higher "
"priority)"
